# 画面印刷 on the x64 PC (tools/x64/ui_run64.py): tools/tests/ui_scrprint.steps with the disks of
# the q35 machine: /boot is nvmea0, second in the list of ファイル変換 at 182,175; the rest as there.
# 画面印刷 (design 11.24), for tools/ui_run.py: the accessory's panel
# (画面印刷／画面保存, 536x284 in the middle of a 1280x800 screen, its
# corner at 372,258; a part at l,t of the panel at 380+l,266+t), worked
# three times. First the whole screen three seconds after 実行 (the
# seconds stepped down from five with ▼), saved as a figure object whose
# name is asked (Enter takes 画面印刷) and whose link goes to the BTRON
# window, where it is opened. Then the window in front, with the pointer, at PrintScreen,
# into the tray. Then a rectangle dragged out on the screen, printed
# (印刷設定 without 画面表示) at every press of PrintScreen, twice, and
# that put away with 取り消し, after which PrintScreen takes nothing.
open 01a0d8c4-53d0-7a21-8b32-4c5d6e7f53d0
expect scrprint: panel 1
wait 600
shot sp_panel
click 414 313
click 650 343
click 414 429
click 716 439
wait 150
click 716 439
wait 150
shot sp_set
click 836 511
wait 800
shot sp_name
key 28
expect scrprint: save to
expect scrprint: armed 1: 0 0 0 0 3
wait 400
shot sp_count
expect scrprint: taken 1 0 0 1280 800
expect scrprint: saved 画面印刷
wait 800
shot sp_saved
# the figure object opened from its link: the screen as a picture
dclick 80 203
wait 2500
shot sp_figure
# the window in front, the pointer in it, at PrintScreen, into the tray
open 01a0d8c4-53d0-7a21-8b32-4c5d6e7f53d0
expect scrprint: panel 2
wait 600
click 414 339
click 650 313
click 650 369
click 414 455
wait 150
shot sp_set2
click 836 511
expect scrprint: armed 2: 1 1 1 1
move 300 300
wait 300
key 46
expect scrprint: taken 2
expect scrprint: tray 1
wait 600
shot sp_tray
# a rectangle, printed at every press, then put away
open 01a0d8c4-53d0-7a21-8b32-4c5d6e7f53d0
expect scrprint: panel 3
wait 600
click 414 365
click 650 313
click 650 395
click 414 481
wait 150
shot sp_set3
click 836 511
wait 1500
shot sp_print_panel
key 28
expect scrprint: pick 1
wait 300
move 120 110
down
move 300 250
move 520 410
wait 300
shot sp_drag
up
expect scrprint: range 1 120 110 521 411
expect scrprint: armed 3: 2 0 2 2
wait 300
key 46
expect scrprint: taken 3 120 110 521 411
expect scrprint: printed 1
wait 1000
shot sp_printed
key 46
expect scrprint: taken 4 120 110 521 411
expect scrprint: printed 2
wait 800
open 01a0d8c4-53d0-7a21-8b32-4c5d6e7f53d0
expect scrprint: panel 4
wait 600
click 444 511
expect scrprint: cancelled 1
wait 300
key 46
wait 1500
shot sp_cancelled
# the tray's picture (from the second time) pasted into the window of the
# figure object: written beside its record, an image of the figure
click 900 700
wait 300
key 19 01
expect tray: picture
wait 800
shot sp_pasted
# ファイル変換 started, /boot (nvmea0) opened and its list moved to the
# right; the link of the figure object carried onto the list: the panel of
# 実身からファイルへ (a press long after the last, or it would be a copy)
open 01a0d8c4-52b1-7c21-9a31-4f5e6d7c8b91
expect xfconv: ready
wait 1000
wins
shot sp_xfc
dclick 182 175
expect xfconv: window nvmea0
wait 600
wins
shot sp_xfc_files
drag 400 144 800 144
wait 300
win nvmea0
click 20 120
wait 1000
drag 70 203 900 450
expect xfconv: asked how to export 1:
wait 600
shot sp_xfc_export
# 画像（PNG）: the figure's picture written as 画面印刷.png in /boot
click 840 409
wait 300
shot sp_xfc_png
key 28
expect xfconv: export as 6 flags 20
expect xfconv: exported
wait 1000
shot sp_xfc_exported
# nothing it did was refused for want of a right
absent !OACV!
